    "show_share": true,
    "description": "In an innovative approach to addressing mental health in underserved areas, BMI has established two regions in Northern Pakistan-Ghizer and Upper Chitral-as \"Living Labs\" for long-term research on mental wellbeing. This initiative, developed in partnership with the Aga Khan Health Service, Pakistan (AKHSP), integrates community-based research with targeted interventions to tackle pressing issues such as depression, substance use, family violence, and the prevention of age-related conditions like Alzheimer's and dementia.",
